[h2]Reporting a bug[/h2]
Press [b]Ctrl+Shift+B[/b] (or [b]Panels → Report a bug[/b]) the moment something goes wrong, say what happened in one line, and press [b]Send report[/b]. The report carries the position you were in, the game's save at the start of the room, the coach's log of the run and the last lines of the mod, game and coach logs (your Windows user name is removed from file paths), so the bug can be replayed exactly. Nothing is sent until you press Send. You get a link on your clipboard; paste it into a comment here or a GitHub issue. [b]Save to file only[/b] writes the same report to [i]%LOCALAPPDATA%\SpireMentor\bugreports\[/i] and sends nothing. The workbench's [b]🐞 Report[/b] button does the same from the browser.

